{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/866619-recognition-of-the-fallen-and-recycled","id":866619,"title":"Recognition of the fallen and recycled?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2016-04-16T19:41:49-07:00","id":866619,"title":"Recognition of the fallen and recycled?","content":"I'm presuming more of a Demonic Form than a cover here.<br /> <br /> If a Demon goes up against an Angel and later the Angel falls, if the Demon were to see the Demonic Form would he recognize it as the Angel eh fought earlier?<br /> <br /> What if a Demon gets recycled? is the body reused? could you end up being attacked by a former friend and be able to recognize them?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.pinterest.com/xenoterracide/chrod-inspirations/\" target=\"_blank\">Graphic Inspirational Photos for Chronicles of Darkness on Pinterest</a> <br /> <a href=\"https://chroniclesofdarkness.slack.com\" target=\"_blank\">Chronicles of Darkness Slack</a> (PM Me with Email for an Invite, then invite your friends)","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4046-xenoterracide","name":"xenoterracide","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4046_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"563"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-16T20:38:48-07:00","id":866642,"title":"","content":"Because this is at its core a horror game I would say that you should definitely be able to recognize the recycled.<br /> <br /> For an angel that has fallen however I feel it should be far more subtle and a slow build up to the realization. Like a new demon npc in town and as the PCs interact with this new demon some details are in line with an angel they once fought with or ran from. Do remember that when a angel falls they are twisted and torn with not everything coming with them as they fall. Not to say that it couldn't be obvious. For instance imagine the horror as the players realize the angel they thought they defeated has fallen and all that drives this new demon is destroying those who robbed them of their life.<br /> <br /> In the end their are no hard line references I can give from the books except that a demon form is based on their angelic form and a recycled may not look like they had after being repurposed but it could give a better narrative if they do.<br /> <br /> The only suggestions I can give are to go where the narrative feel best. Allied sacrificed themselves so the party could escape? Their ally as an angel once more begins to hunt them. Will they destroy the angel or try to cause it to fall once again?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2909-mr-f-i-x","name":"Mr.F.I.X.","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2909_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"May 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1053"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-17T03:23:15-07:00","id":866742,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>xenoterracide</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/866619-recognition-of-the-fallen-and-recycled#post866619\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm presuming more of a Demonic Form than a cover here.<br /> <br /> If a Demon goes up against an Angel and later the Angel falls, if the Demon were to see the Demonic Form would he recognize it as the Angel eh fought earlier?<br /> <br /> What if a Demon gets recycled? is the body reused? could you end up being attacked by a former friend and be able to recognize them?</div> </div> </div> </div>Maybe, not definitely and maybe but probably not respectively. Both are really down the ST. Personally, when I think about demons being recycled I literally imagine them being torn apart for spare parts, not simply reprogrammed, but that's just personal taste. I like the idea of recognizing bits, though, and I'm currently running a chronicle where a lot demon-parts are being taken for assembly into a massive angel which will do just that.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 04-17-2016, 06:26 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-18T23:35:41-07:00","id":868220,"title":"","content":"I do both methods, with some demons are unfortunately merely used for spare materials, while others are recast and reformatted with very little dismemberment involved, allowing for the horror of seeing old friends and rivals returned to the angelic state- they look more angelic, but their old demonic form is still recognizable. Hell, maybe they even have the same Cover they possessed while Unchained.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T00:02:16-07:00","id":868233,"title":"","content":"I would say an Angel who later falls would probably be more easily recognized. Not 100%, but not because the demon wouldn't recognize the Angel and more just not being sure it is the same Angel. As for the recycled, I'm in the crowd that thinks that large portions of the Demon are probably replaced to prevent problems like what occurred with its predecessor.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T02:44:26-07:00","id":868286,"title":"","content":"I agree, especially recycled demons possessing different parts, but not too many- don't wanna be completely unrecognized","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1686,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","user":"Korogra","date":". 04-19-2016, 05:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2016-04-19T10:20:05-07:00","id":868537,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Korogra</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/866619-recognition-of-the-fallen-and-recycled?p=868220#post868220\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Hell, maybe they even have the same Cover they possessed while Unchained.</div> </div> </div> </div>OK, that's awesome enough to sell me on this 100%. It's perfectly cold war espionage and great paranoia fuel. <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://fo